            "Save any section or page from the editor: open the block\u2019s \u22ee menu and choose \u201cSave to cloud library\u201d. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.": [
                "Fipam\u1ecd apakan tabi oju-iwe eyikeyi lati inu olutun\u1e63e: \u1e63ii ako\u1e63\u1ecd \u22ee bul\u1ecd\u1ecdki naa ki o si yan \u201cFipam\u1ecd si ile-ikawe aw\u1ecd\u1e63\u1eb9\u201d. Fi aw\u1ecdn ap\u1eb9r\u1eb9 ti a fipam\u1ecd sinu lati inu igbim\u1ecd ile-ikawe Aw\u1ecd\u1e63\u1eb9 ti o wa ninu olutun\u1e63e, sori eyikeyi ninu aw\u1ecdn aaye ayelujara r\u1eb9."
