            "Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: https:\/\/s3.<region>.amazonaws.com) and the bucket\u2019s region.": [
                "Wa ibi-iw\u1ecdle S3 (fun Amazon S3: https:\/\/s3.<region>.amazonaws.com) ati agbegbe agba f\u1ecd\u1ecdmu naa."
            ],
